      "created_at": "2014-12-30T04:24:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I know they are still considered Environment cards because of their backs, but are they \"in play\". I'd have thought not, but Ra played Scorched Earth in the app today and it counted both cards underneath SDS too.&nbsp;</p><p><span>On a related note, I know facedown cards have no text, so what happens if I want to hypothetically destroy a card under SDS with, say, Flash Flood? &nbsp;Are you allowed to look at the front of the card you destroy before you pick it?</span></p>",
